      "hit_at_5": null,
      "citation_precision": null,
      "mode": "hybrid",
      "answer": "**Main idea**\n\nThe paper introduces the **Transformer**, a new neural network architecture that **eliminates recurrence and convolution entirely and relies only on attention mechanisms** (specifically self\u2011attention and multi\u2011head attention) to model global dependencies between input and output sequences. This design enables much greater parallelization and achieves state\u2011of\u2011the\u2011art translation performance with significantly reduced training time.",
      "route_got": "overview",
